[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2820.309, "timestamp": "00:47:00", "text": "真实的。老兄，告诉我这是真的。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2822.39, "timestamp": "00:47:02", "text": "这是个新角色，对吧？或许。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2831.63, "timestamp": "00:47:11", "text": "她是在为这个角色配音吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2835.829, "timestamp": "00:47:15", "text": "嗯，激怒我？就是这样，就像……呃呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2838.15, "timestamp": "00:47:18", "text": "这首歌应该是这个角色的出场曲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2841.67, "timestamp": "00:47:21", "text": "我的天啊。卡夫卡也提到了卡夫卡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2843.95, "timestamp": "00:47:23", "text": "就像卡凡一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2847.75, "timestamp": "00:47:27", "text": "Morop Morali 就像做……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2850.63, "timestamp": "00:47:30", "text": "是演唱会吧？如果我没记错的话。我看见"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2853.75, "timestamp": "00:47:33", "text": "这条推文。我不知道我在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2856.87, "timestamp": "00:47:36", "text": "它？我看到了那条推文。我看到了海报"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2859.51, "timestamp": "00:47:39", "text": "东西打开了。对，就是这个。这个。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2862.27, "timestamp": "00:47:42", "text": "一。大阪虚拟医疗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2876.109, "timestamp": "00:47:56", "text": "好的。"}]